## Section 3 — Retrieval Indexes

```sql
-- primary lookup path: "commentary on Romans 8:28"
CREATE INDEX idx_commentary_passage
ON commentary (book, chapter, verse_start, verse_end);

-- domain-scoped queries (required for RLS performance —
-- FKs are not auto-indexed in Postgres)
CREATE INDEX idx_commentary_domain_id
ON commentary (domain_id);

-- "all commentary by this expert"
CREATE INDEX idx_commentary_expert_id
ON commentary (expert_id);
```

