## Section 6 — Explicitly Out of Scope

- Scripture verse text / `bible_reference_index` caching — remains on
  the live Bible API path. Deferred until post-SBIR rebuild.
- OSHA content structure — covered separately (citation/regulatory
  hierarchy model, not passage-based; see OSHA domain decisions).
- Orchestration, Memory, and Commercial layers (guardrail execution
  logging, user query history, subscriptions) — future-state scope,
  not part of this table.
- `trust_level` / retrieval-priority logic for multi-edition
  resolution — see Section 5, item 4 follow-up. Application-layer
  concern, to be defined in a future ingestion-layer document.

